{#
  Video card — a house-styled link to a video interview (2026-10-19, JM).

  A static still (self-hosted) with a play mark, the episode title in the
  site's type, and a one-line note; the whole card links out to YouTube.
  No iframe and no third-party request on page load, in line with the
  Get Updates block's no-embed rule. JM chose a house card over the show's
  own thumbnail, whose headline reads as a promise the site never makes.

  Set before including:
    vc_body  — one or two sentences for this page (required)
  Copy canon and placements: SITE_GUIDE (Video card section).
#}
<style>
.vc-wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 1.4rem auto 1.8rem; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; }
.vc-card {
  display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
  background: rgba(224,148,34,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(224,148,34,0.18);
  border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .2s, background .2s;
}
.vc-card:hover, .vc-card:focus-visible { border-color: rgba(247,147,26,0.55); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.07); }
.vc-card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #F7931A; outline-offset: 2px; }
.vc-still { position: relative; flex: 0 0 240px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #14110d; }
.vc-still img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 60% 25%; }
.vc-still::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,9,8,0.05), rgba(10,9,8,0.35)); }
.vc-play {
  position: absolute; left: 12px; bottom: 12px; z-index: 1;
  width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(10,9,8,0.72);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(247,147,26,0.9); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.vc-play::before { content: ''; margin-left: 4px; border-style: solid; border-width: 9px 0 9px 15px; border-color: transparent transparent transparent #F7931A; }
.vc-text { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; padding: 1rem 1.3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.vc-wrap p.vc-kicker { font-size: 0.66rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #e09422; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
.vc-wrap p.vc-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; color: #f2eee8; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
.vc-wrap p.vc-body { font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0 0 0.45rem; }
.vc-wrap .vc-cta { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F7931A; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .vc-card { flex-direction: column; }
  .vc-still { flex-basis: auto; width: 100%; }
}
</style>
<div class="vc-wrap">
  <a class="vc-card" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQhk4KKqMss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <div class="vc-still">
      <img src="/interview-robin-seyr.jpg" alt="John McCabe" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <span class="vc-play" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="vc-text">
      <p class="vc-kicker">Watch &middot; The Robin Seyr Podcast &middot; September 2026</p>
      <p class="vc-title">Every 0.2 Bitcoin Retires You 3 Years Faster</p>
      <p class="vc-body">{{ vc_body | safe }}</p>
      <span class="vc-cta">Watch on YouTube &#8599;</span>
    </div>
  </a>
</div>
